# =============================================
# Ant CLI Environment Configuration
# =============================================
# 
# Copy the appropriate file based on your environment:
#
#   Local development:
#     cp .env.example.localenv .env
#
#   Cloud deployment:
#     cp .env.example.cloud .env
#
# File descriptions:
#   .env.example.local  - Single server, in-memory state
#   .env.example.cloud  - Distributed deployment, Redis-based
#
# =============================================
